&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.frognew.com/2018/10/kubernetes-kube-proxy-enable-ipvs.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Kubernetes upgrade from 1.10 to 1.11 (cont.): enable IPVS mode for kube-proxy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://lingxiankong.github.io/2018-07-20-katacontainer-docker-k8s.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Integrating Kata Containers with Docker and Kubernetes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
